Package: cc-link
Version: 0.0.0-replaced-by-makefile
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Depends: replaced-by-makefile
Maintainer: Jérôme Poulin <jeromepoulin@gmail.com>
Description: Bridge Claude Code cross-session messaging across machines
 Relays Claude Code's cross-session messaging between two machines over a
 single SSH stdio channel, publishing a mirror of the remote session into
 the local registry so it appears as an ordinary local peer. Includes an
 MCP server for attaching and detaching links.
